activity Submit Benefit Request
activity Review Benefit Request
activity Approve Benefit
activity Reject Benefit
activity Notify Employee
activity Process Payment
activity Update Employee Record
activity Audit Benefit Process
activity Submit Appeal
activity Review Appeal
activity Approve Appeal
activity Reject Appeal
activity Notify Appeal Decision
activity Conduct Benefit Orientation
activity Evaluate Benefit Utilization
bind Submit Benefit Request: Request ID, Benefit Type, Employee ID
bind Review Benefit Request: Request ID, Request Status
bind Approve Benefit: Request ID
bind Reject Benefit: Request ID
bind Notify Employee: Employee ID, Request ID, Notification Count
bind Process Payment: Request ID
bind Update Employee Record: Employee ID, Request ID
bind Audit Benefit Process: Audit ID, Request ID
bind Submit Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID, Appeal Status
bind Review Appeal: Request ID, Appeal Status
bind Approve Appeal: Request ID
bind Reject Appeal: Request ID
bind Notify Appeal Decision: Employee ID, Request ID
bind Conduct Benefit Orientation: Orientation ID, Employee ID
bind Evaluate Benefit Utilization: Utilization Rate, Employee ID
Request ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Benefit Type: Health Insurance, Retirement Plan, Paid Leave, Education Assistance
Employee ID: integer between 1 and 5000
Request Status: Approved, Rejected
Notification Count: integer between 1 and 2
Appeal Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Appeal ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Audit ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Utilization Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Orientation ID: integer between 1 and 500
Init[Submit Benefit Request] | |
Existence[Review Benefit Request] | |
Precedence[Approve Benefit, Review Benefit Request] |T.Request Status is Approved |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |
Precedence[Reject Benefit, Review Benefit Request] |T.Request Status is Rejected |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |
Response[Approve Benefit, Notify Employee] | |(A.Request ID == T.Request ID) AND (T.Notification Count <= 2) |0,2,d
Response[Reject Benefit, Notify Employee] | |(A.Request ID == T.Request ID) AND (T.Notification Count <= 2) |0,2,d
Response[Approve Benefit, Process Payment] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,7,d
Response[Approve Benefit, Update Employee Record] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,5,d
Response[Process Payment, Audit Benefit Process] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,30,d
Response[Submit Appeal, Review Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,5,d
Response[Approve Appeal, Notify Appeal Decision] | |(A.Request ID == T.Request ID) |0,2,d
Response[Reject Appeal, Notify Appeal Decision] | |(A.Request ID == T.Request ID) |0,2,d
Existence[Conduct Benefit Orientation] | |
Existence[Evaluate Benefit Utilization] | |
End[Notify Employee] | |